{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03319","headline":"故赵王属赠黄门侍郎上官公挽词二首 一 · 宋之问","name":"故赵王属赠黄门侍郎上官公挽词二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"韦门旌旧德，班氏业前书。\n谪去因丞相，归来爲倢伃。\n周原乌相冢，越岭雁随车。\n冥漠辞昭代，空怜赋子虚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03319.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03319","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}